    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f47ca2953c1f4c549992bcfe771cd3e3",
      "statement": "On the embedding side, Bifrost settings are resolved when the creator is constructed (CachedEmbeddingCreator's constructor invokes the overridden createEmbeddingModel), and the parallel path of calculateEmbeddings builds one model instance per worker thread via another createEmbeddingModel call, so a full 40-worker batch re-resolves the BIFROST_API_KEY/BIFROST_URL pair through the shared helper up to 40 times.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/embedding/BifrostEmbeddingCreator.java#L48-L57",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9a3c9cba94445c6a52377602672442e1ad790f44a587d129f11968909192d7fd:"
