      "id": "claim_6b6bb666c7c147e683a7e98e33c3c429",
      "statement": "Bifrost models are addressed as provider-prefixed names (openai/gpt-4o-mini for chat, openai/text-embedding-3-small for embeddings); the full prefixed string is passed to the client builders and becomes the EmbeddingCacheParameter model name, so it is part of the embedding cache identity.",
