    {
      "id": "claim_1a3360eed82f4f6a9243b3be04eecbd5",
      "statement": "CachedEmbeddingCreator.findEncoding makes the embedding token-length recovery path work for provider-prefixed Bifrost model names: it queries the jtokkit registry with the name as given first and, when unknown and the name contains a slash, retries the lookup with everything up to and including the last slash stripped (openai/text-embedding-3-small resolves text-embedding-3-small); a name unknown in both forms aborts recovery with IllegalArgumentException.",
      "evidence": [
