      "id": "claim_504a02a9a7e441e0ad40ee7e2868472e",
      "statement": "The regular Maven Verify workflow (verify.yml) delegates to the shared ardoco Maven workflow and passes only Central/GPG credentials — no Bifrost secrets — so in standard CI the hermetic suite runs while the env-gated BifrostIntegrationTest silently skips; bifrost.yml is the only CI context in which the library actually calls a Bifrost gateway.",
